GENT", "message": "Hey Tucker! Are you down there? I don't see anyone, but maybe you're in an invisible tank. Tucker? Hello?", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true, "satisfied": true}], "responses": [{"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "We need to bug out.  I'm reading even more units approaching from the south.  They're going to overwhelm you Tucker, you can't outmaneuver them all.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "You're right, Argent, we can't hold here.  Those units are too effective on this terrain.  We need to get near the coast, cut off one of the their angles of attack. Durand can rendezvous with us there.  That should make for a nice surprise.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}]}]}}